el druid-data-nonempty\">\nS+</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nStormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.45%<br />Mansion: 0.003%<br />Mineshaft: 0.91%<br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.03%<br />Carnival: 0.003%<br /><b>Expanded Mineshaft: 90.90%</b><br />Grand Armory: 1.52%<br />Greenhouse: 0.12%<br />Rubber Rooms: 6.06%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n21</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 2</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nHoarding Bug, Bracken, Backwater Gunkfish, Bunker Spider</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nBaboon Hawk</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n8</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n6</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Research\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Research</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Deep within the jungles of <b>Chasm</b> lie a cluster of large ravines. At the bottom of these ravines, caves and caverns of highly profitable resources. While mining corporations were desperate to get their hands on said resources. The working class was not quite as excited. The flora would not care what it caught. High value items remain inside.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Warm. Moist, often hit by heavy rains.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Dominated by a few species.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Chasm supports Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, and Forsaken weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<p>Chasm's exterior has a unique map hazard called a \"Sinkmaw\". It is an opening in the ground that will shut if a player falls into it and begin filling with acid. This acid deals 10 damage per hit and will eventually rise high enough to submerge the player, but drowning can be temporarily prevented by jumping. Approximately 20 instances of damage, or 200 damage total, will occur before the acid fully recedes and the Sinkmaw opens back up. A player stuck in a Sinkmaw can only escape through another player teleporting them or, likely unintended, using an extension ladder to clip through it.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Interacting with the note found on the wall of a tent on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Junic\" title=\"Junic\">Junic</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\"><big><b>Gloom:</b></big></a> Gloom videotape that randomly spawns as scrap within the interior.</span></span><br /><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Hyve\" title=\"Hyve\"><big><b>Hyve:</b></big></a> A breakable hive has a chance to spawn on the exterior and contains the Hyve videotape.</span></span><br /><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\"><big><b>ResearcherxB:</b></big></a> Chasm can be one of the random moons that requires placing a Triangulation Device on its exterior.</span></span><br /><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Spine\" title=\"Spine\"><big><b>Spine:</b></big></a> Craft a \"Blank floppy disc\" on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>, insert it into the Floppy Disc Machine on Chasm's exterior, and log \"Spine floppy disc\".</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Airhorn</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Airhorn.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Airhorn.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/60px-Airhorn.png?6146f4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/90px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Airhorn.png/120px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0.60%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amethyst cluster</td>\n<td><div class=