 class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Entities\">&gt; Entities</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Interior.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hoarding Bug</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>26.87%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bracken</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>19.90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backwater Gunkfish</td>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>16.42%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bunker Spider</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>12.94%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hygrodere</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>11.94%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snare Flea</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>9.95%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cadaver Growth</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1.99%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Exterior.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baboon Hawk</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>55.17%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eyeless Dog</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>22.99%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Honey_Stinger\" title=\"Honey Stinger\">Honey Stinger</a></td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>21.84%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Daytime_Enemies.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manticoil</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>45.12%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roaming Locusts</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>31.71%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Circuit Bees</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>23.17%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Lore\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Lore\">&gt; Lore</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Research\">Research</span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Transcript security recording - Day 15<br />\u2014----------------------- 11:56 - Lab<br /><br />S. Dent: Out of all the specimens we have gathered, this one seems the most potent.<br />C. Darter: On that I agree. We would only have to bioengineer the instinctual need to spread out of the samples before it can be merged and experimented with.<br />S. Dent: Of course. I noted on the spider back on Utril that the exoskeleton seemed to have hardened with an increased density to help it protect itself from brute force impact.<br />C. Darter: I wonder if it would do the same to a bone structure or if it would respond to the skin instead.<br />S. Dent: Either way it would likely induce extreme pain, shock and possibly death were we to try that on an animal or even a person.<br />C. Darter: I am aware. Though I doubt Solover cares as long as we can get a subject to survive.<br />S. Dent: You\u2019re probably right. But try finding medical research where animals didn\u2019t suffer.<br />C. Darter: Does it ever bother you? The screeches of pain whenever we have to test on a live subject.<br />S. Dent: Yeah.. Of course it does. I don\u2019t enjoy it. I try to remind myself that we\u2019re doing this now so that people in the future will be able to live a better life. It doesn\u2019t make it better but it\u2019s how I deal with it.<br />C. Darter: I suppose that makes sense.<br /><br />\u2014----------------------- 12:46 - Central hallway<br /><br />C. Darter: Stand guard at the lab in case anything goes awry.<br />J. Charter: Yes sir.<br />\u2014----------------------- 13:08 - Lab<br /><br />J. Charter: Everything okay here?<br />S. Dent: Yeah, did something happen?<br />J. Charter: No no, I was sent by Cavil. He said I should keep watch in case anything happened.<br />S. Dent: Fair enough. We\u2019re only working with a highly infectious aggressive fungi haha.<br />J. Charter: Yeah hah.<br />J. Charter: The experiments that are conducted here, are they very dangerous?<br />S. Dent: In the wrong hands, yes, very. Handle them wrong and we could have an outbreak. A scenario like that can only end nasty.<br />J. Charter: Good thing you\u2019re so skilled then.<br />S. Dent: Yeah, thanks.<br />J. Charter: I am curious though, do you feel.. safe.. Here? On the ship?<br />S. Dent: Well. Not always. These are very dangerous things we\u2019re working with. But in the end it\u2019s part of the job, it\u2019s what we signed up for. I feel you of all people would probably know that.<br />J. Charter: We have our duties, even if it\u2019s dangerous. We\u2019re building a future. That\u2019s important.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2></div>", "images": ["Chasm_